# Agent KBase development

* Product truth for this repo: `brain/facts/` and `brain/open-questions.md`. Run `pnpm brain:sync-learn` after learn doc changes; `pnpm validate:brain` before big agent tasks.
* Shared logic lives in `packages/core`; browser safe exports in `@agentkbase/core/browser`.
* Templates are embedded via `packages/templates/scripts/embed-files.mjs` before build.
* CLI must not duplicate pack logic; web wizard uses the same validation as `brain validate`.
* `@agentkbase/mcp` calls `@agentkbase/core` for brief, validate, and brain file reads. It does not write `brain/`.
